      "id": 9301,
      "name": "Pydro",
      "username": "Pydro",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-01-20T04:46:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think it's time for another <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/sotm-event-5-grudge-match-4381\">Grudge Match</a>. Same rules as before, except I am making Ambuscade a 1, and Gloomweaver a 2, unless people object to it. For a tie-breaker, I am going to hand pick a final match. If it is still a tie, all tied teams win.</p><p>You can sign up your team <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheet/ccc?key=0AidOKG-M_yQmdFBYN2JLcHA5RDRWcFBZc2swS0pNblE&amp;usp=sharing\">here</a>. I will wait a bit for the teams to sign up before posting the first match.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Quick summary of the rules:</p><p>*There are 4 rounds. The first is against a random difficulty 1 villain, then a difficulty 2, etc.</p><p>*A random environment will be chosen, but an environment from that expanstion won't be chosen agains.</p><p>*You can choose any heroes to fight in a round, but those heroes cannot be used again for this event.</p><p>*No promo heroes or villains. No Vengeance heroes.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:02.991Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
